# Linux deployment target — LF in repo and on checkout (even on Windows dev machines)
#
# Windows devs: Git for Windows ships with system core.autocrlf=true, which fights
# eol=lf. After clone, run once in this repo:
#   git config core.autocrlf false
#
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (skip line-ending conversion)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.db binary
